                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6, marginLeft: 22 }}>
                    纯编解码最不耐受采样不均。
                </Text>

                <Box style={{ marginTop: 26, padding: '14px 18px', background: '#FBF3F2', borderLeft: '4px solid #C0392B' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C0392B' }}>+3.33%</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
